    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/2fae180d7f9ede2546ed2d0b824d6b76.poster.avif?t=1744918961\" width=450 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/2fae180d7f9ede2546ed2d0b824d6b76.webm?t=1744918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/2fae180d7f9ede2546ed2d0b824d6b76.mp4?t=1744918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique puzzles involving magnets and electricity </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/d6399e81415a53c833f0f5bf49842943.poster.avif?t=1744918961\" width=150 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/d6399e81415a53c833f0f5bf49842943.webm?t=1744918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute lab rats</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/3630dc9d1359261263d4635a543d4fe5.poster.avif?t=1744918961\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/3630dc9d1359261263d4635a543d4fe5.webm?t=1744918961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376410/extras/3630dc9d1359261263d4635a543d4fe5.mp4?t=1744918961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi